<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>Link LeetCode Account</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
    }
    
    .navbar {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      padding: 15px 30px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }
    
    .navbar-content {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    
    .navbar-brand {
      color: white;
      font-size: 1.5em;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    
    .navbar-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    
    .navbar-link {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }
    
    .navbar-link:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    }
    
    .navbar-link.active {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    }
    
    .container {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    
    .header {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ecef;
    }
    
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 2.5em;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: #333;
    }
    
    .header p {
      margin: 10px 0 0 0;
      color: #6c757d;
      font-size: 1.1em;
    }
    
    .content {
      padding: 30px;
    }
    
    .step-section {
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      padding: 25px;
      background: #f8f9fa;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
    }
    
    .step-section h3 {
      color: #333;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    
    .step-section p {
      color: #6c757d;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    
    .step-list {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }
    
    .step-list li {
      color: #6c757d;
      margin: 8px 0;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    
    .code-block {
      background: #2d3748;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-family: 'Monaco', 'Menlo', 'Ubuntu Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.9em;
      margin: 15px 0;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }
    
    .highlight-box {
      background: #e7f3ff;
      border: 1px solid #b3d9ff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    
    .highlight-box h4 {
      color: #004085;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    
    .highlight-box p {
      color: #004085;
      margin: 0;
    }
    
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      background: #667eea;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      margin: 10px 10px 10px 0;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    
    .btn:hover {
      background: #5a6fd8;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    }
    
    .btn-primary {
      background: #667eea;
    }
    
    .btn-secondary {
      background: #6c757d;
    }
    
    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: #5a6268;
    }
    
    .extension-info {
      background: #fff3cd;
      border: 1px solid #ffeaa7;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    
    .extension-info h4 {
      color: #856404;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    
    .extension-info p {
      color: #856404;
      margin: 0;
    }
    
    .warning-box {
      background: #f8d7da;
      border: 1px solid #f5c6cb;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    
    .warning-box h4 {
      color: #721c24;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    
    .warning-box p {
      color: #721c24;
      margin: 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="navbar">
    <div class="navbar-content">
      <a href="/dashboard" class="navbar-brand">LeetCode Tracker</a>
      <div class="navbar-links">
        <a href="/dashboard" class="navbar-link active">Dashboard</a>
        <a href="/problems" class="navbar-link">Problems</a>
        <a href="/logout" class="navbar-link">Logout</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Link Your LeetCode Account</h1>
      <p>Follow these steps to connect your LeetCode account and start tracking your progress</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
      <div class="step-section">
        <h3>Step 1: Install the Chrome Extension</h3>
        <p>First, you need to install our Chrome extension to securely link your LeetCode account.</p>
        
        <ol class="step-list">
          <li>Open Chrome and navigate to <code>chrome://extensions/</code></li>
          <li>Enable "Developer mode" in the top right corner</li>
          <li>Click "Load unpacked" and select the <code>public/chrome-extension</code> folder from this project</li>
          <li>You should see "LeetCode Tracker" appear in your extensions list</li>
        </ol>
        
        <div class="highlight-box">
          <h4>Important</h4>
          <p>Make sure you're using Chrome or a Chromium-based browser for this to work.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="step-section">
        <h3>Step 2: Log in to LeetCode</h3>
        <p>Ensure you're logged into your LeetCode account before proceeding.</p>
        
        <ol class="step-list">
          <li>Go to <a href="https://leetcode.com" target="_blank">leetcode.com</a></li>
          <li>Sign in with your LeetCode credentials</li>
          <li>Verify you can see your profile and solved problems</li>
        </ol>
        
        <a href="https://leetcode.com" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">Go to LeetCode</a>
      </div>
      
      <div class="step-section">
        <h3>Step 3: Link Your Account</h3>
        <p>Use the Chrome extension to securely link your LeetCode account.</p>
        
        <ol class="step-list">
          <li>Click the LeetCode Tracker extension icon in your Chrome toolbar</li>
          <li>Click "Link Account" to connect your LeetCode account</li>
          <li>Your account will be automatically created and linked</li>
          <li>You'll be redirected to your dashboard</li>
        </ol>
        
        <div class="extension-info">
          <h4>Chrome Extension Required</h4>
          <p>The extension securely fetches your LeetCode authentication cookies and sends them to this application to establish the connection.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="step-section">
        <h3>How It Works</h3>
        <p>Our Chrome extension securely communicates with this application to:</p>
        
        <ul class="step-list">
          <li>Fetch your LeetCode authentication cookies</li>
          <li>Create a secure connection between your LeetCode account and our app</li>
          <li>Sync your profile data, solved problems, and submission history</li>
          <li>Enable real-time progress tracking and note-taking</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="warning-box">
        <h4>Security Note</h4>
        <p>Your LeetCode cookies are only sent to this local development server. The extension only requests necessary permissions and doesn't store sensitive data locally. All communication is encrypted and secure.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="step-section">
        <h3>Need Help?</h3>
        <p>If you encounter any issues during the setup process:</p>
        
        <ul class="step-list">
          <li>Make sure you're logged into LeetCode</li>
          <li>Check that this Rails server is running</li>
          <li>Try refreshing the extension popup</li>
          <li>Check the browser console for error messages</li>
          <li>Ensure the extension is properly loaded in Chrome</li>
        </ul>
        
        <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-secondary">Back to Dashboard</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>

